# SentinelNet Workspace Rules for Cline

See [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) — canonical agent instructions for this repo
(communication style, coding style, branch model, SemVer, the "protect real
data" rules and the pre-commit checklist).

This file used to restate them and drifted: it still named
`python -m unittest discover -s tests` after the suite had moved to
`pytest --dist loadfile`, and it never carried the data-protection section at
all. One copy, in AGENTS.md.
